September 32 — Licence Notice
=============================

Copyright (c) 2026 the September 32 project authors. All rights reserved.

STATUS: PROVISIONAL. The final licensing of this project has NOT been decided.
This file exists so that the repository has an unambiguous default, not because
a decision has been made. See docs/legal/LICENSING.md and
docs/decisions/ADR-0003-asset-licensing.md.

1. ORIGINAL CONTENT (all rights reserved)
-----------------------------------------
All original content in this repository — including but not limited to the
script, dialogue, story, lore, setting, characters, names, marks, artwork,
music, and design documents — is proprietary. No licence, express or implied,
is granted to copy, distribute, modify, sublicense, or create derivative works
from it.

2. SOURCE CODE
--------------
The source code (the `s32_engine` package, the `s32tools` package, Ren'Py
scripts, build scripts and CI configuration) is likewise all rights reserved
for now. The project intends to relicense the *engine and tooling* portion
under a permissive open-source licence at a later date, once the boundary
between reusable code and proprietary narrative content is stable. Until that
decision is recorded in an ADR, treat this code as proprietary.

3. THIRD-PARTY MATERIAL
-----------------------
This repository does not vendor third-party binaries. Third-party assets are
fetched to `assets/vendor/` on the developer's own machine and remain governed
solely by their own licences, which are recorded in `assets/catalog/assets.toml`
with acquisition evidence in `assets/evidence/`. Nothing in this file grants any
right over third-party material. See THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md and CREDITS.md.

4. NO WARRANTY
--------------
THE MATERIAL IN THIS REPOSITORY IS PROVIDED "AS IS", WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY
KIND, EXPRESS OR IMPLIED.
